.TH COUNT_FILES 1 "November 2026" "count-files 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
count_files \- count files in a directory
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B count_files
.RI [ directory ]
.RI [ extension ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Count files in the specified directory and its subdirectories.
Display the number of files and their total size in bytes.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B directory
Directory to search. Default: /etc.
.TP
.B extension
File extension to search for. Default: conf.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B count_files
Count .conf files in /etc.
.TP
.B count_files /home/user txt
Count .txt files in /home/user and its subdirectories.
.SH AUTHOR
Maksym Hrebinnyk
